Per Apache-2.0 section 4(b), the files in this directory have been modified
from the original SuperSec sources. Notable changes by the CantoFlow project:

  - Rebranded from SuperSec to CantoFlow (package name, application identifiers,
    per-user data directories, single-instance key, and UI strings).
  - Added a macOS development backend (pbcopy/pbpaste clipboard) so the client
    launches on a Mac for development; macOS is not a shipping target.
  - Added a pytest test suite (transcript cleaning, energy-VAD auto-stop,
    config round-trip, Simplified/Traditional conversion).
  - Added GitHub Actions CI that runs the tests on Linux/Windows/macOS and
    builds the Windows executable as a downloadable artifact.

